    <tag k="description:en" v="A hike of cultural and natural interest through villages, fields, and trails. Points of cultural interest include Tossicia, the ruins of the Franciscan convent, Azzinano and its murals, and Cusciano. It also offers beautiful views of the Gran Sasso and th"/>
